u − u 0 = p (x − x 0) + q (y − y 0), {\displaystyle u-u_{0}=p(x-x_{0})+q(y-y_{0}),\,}

where

F (x 0, y 0, u 0, p, q) = 0. {\displaystyle F(x_{0},y_{0},u_{0},p,q)=0.\,}

